  "voice_id": "nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb",
  "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
  "estimated_cost_usd": 0.311,
  "total_seconds": 60.1,
  "master": "H:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-065-marmet\\06_voice\\draft\\short270\\en_us\\short270_vc_draft_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "West Virginia's highest court called the Supreme Court's arbitration reasoning tendentious and created from whole cloth. Those were the state court's words.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 8.591,
      "seconds": 8.591,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:100a579cc39b79fc18fb39233585af0d4564077ed0de401cea3df44a47572761"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The Supreme Court answered that the state's interpretation was incorrect and inconsistent with clear instructions in its own precedents.",
      "start": 8.811,
      "end": 16.566,
      "seconds": 7.755,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:8ec19cbca8fbf60c77ccecd76cac88843b20a60af258e0c015da9f1e41f77cde"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "It added a constitutional command: once the Court interprets federal law, a state court may not contradict or refuse to implement that rule.",
      "start": 16.786,
      "end": 24.82,
      "seconds": 8.034,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:97b7b5d9fc585406f8c20774f28686e1cb5ca58db14bcd47fd8e42cab5d9dad4"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The decision was per curiam: no Justice was named as author, and the opinion reported no vote.",
      "start": 25.04,
      "end": 30.984,
      "seconds": 5.944,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:87549f2b7cd6eaa083ed5b3e6130f7ff70a6531e8b955a605e2f9e40ca4cb1e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Washington vacated the judgment and remanded. It did not itself decide whether any particular arbitration clause was valid.",
      "start": 31.204,
      "end": 38.356,
      "seconds": 7.152,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:6f16a3cfe6ca2f3f0e503c356d1722d058a7fcefbecc1f6fc8595fb0985a3515"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Back in West Virginia, the court obeyed by overruling the one syllabus point the Supreme Court had rejected.",
      "start": 38.576,
      "end": 43.87,
      "seconds": 5.294,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:782270078437f63a030cf1aaba791026139a413393a7e1556bb740477e7a9688"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "It then said the mandate did not require changing its remaining analysis of ordinary state contract law, including unconscionability.",
      "start": 44.09,
      "end": 51.242,
      "seconds": 7.152,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:974a87407dfd1d5ca130fcff5d14eebc968643154646d2782b0c67818210c2f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "So the state court complied on the federal rule but preserved the rest, leaving the conflict framed by its opening words: tendentious, whole cloth.",
      "start": 51.462,
      "end": 60.1,
      "seconds": 8.638,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:9b23d3742b14a37c2b99a3a654122f463223ae854563b4b3040b34c1a7360d1e"
    }
  ]
}
